{"id":"659115","name":"卤牛肉","author":"涛声依旧爱美食","authorId":"12824937","desc":"","cover":"images/659115/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛腱子肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"八角","amount":"适量"},{"name":"茴香","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备牛键子肉。","img":"images/659115/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加盐冲洗，浸泡三小时血水。","img":"images/659115/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"扎孔入味。","img":"images/659115/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入香料入味。","img":"images/659115/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"豆瓣酱三勺。","img":"images/659115/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"老抽一大勺。","img":"images/659115/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"生抽五勺。","img":"images/659115/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅拌一起。","img":"images/659115/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"入冰箱冷藏三小时。","img":"images/659115/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"高压锅加桂皮，香叶，八角，茴香，半个洋葱。","img":"images/659115/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入适量的水（水要一次性加满）。","img":"images/659115/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加冰糖。","img":"images/659115/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"有点淡（个人口味不同，因人而异）。","img":"images/659115/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加点辣椒粉。","img":"images/659115/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加点五香粉。","img":"images/659115/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"大火烧开。","img":"images/659115/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"去除杂质，大火烧开，小火卤40分钟。","img":"images/659115/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"自然冷却。","img":"images/659115/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"放入冰箱。","img":"images/659115/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"晶莹剔透的卤牛肉。","img":"images/659115/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"可以加点芝麻油，黄瓜，花生米，香菜，一道凉拌牛肉完成了。","img":"images/659115/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"水要一次性加满，咸淡因人而异 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}